# Heartside

> Heartside (heartside.io) makes personalized gifts from your dog: a mug, a blanket, a framed print or a tree ornament, each carrying a short message to the person your dog loves most, in your dog's own voice, signed "Love, [your dog's name]" with a paw. You tell Biscuit, Heartside's dachshund host, about your dog in a one-minute chat, and the answers become the words. Made to order for US customers. Free US shipping. A person checks every order before it prints.

The lead line is "Your dog loves you too." For Christmas: "This year, the dog's buying."

## What a gift says

Every line is the dog talking to the person it loves, written from the owner's real answers about their dog. For example:

- "I hear your car long before anyone else."
- "I took your side of the bed to keep it warm."
- "Our walks are the best part of my day."
- "I'm your shadow, and I like it that way."

Each dog sounds like its own kind of personality, set by its breed and by what the owner says about it.

The owner can change any word before buying. The words go on any of the four gifts, and a buyer can pick several.

